.TH kakashi-replay 1  "replay " 
.SH NAME
kakashi\-replay \- Re\-run a recorded experiment from its manifest and check for reproducibility (§32)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBkakashi replay\fR [\fB\-\-state\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Re\-run a recorded experiment from its manifest and check for reproducibility (§32)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-state\fR \fI<STATE>\fR [default: .]
Directory containing (or to contain) the `.kakashi/` state directory (§34)
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: human]

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
human
.IP \(bu 2
json
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>

